     <!DOCTYPE html>
     <html lang="en">
     <head>
       <meta charset="UTF-8" />
       <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
       <title>Calculator</title>
       <style>
         body {
           font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif;
